1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,180
So I tried separating how knowledge is stored from how it is organized.

2
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:11,080
Documents could still live in normal folders.

3
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:17,360
But their links and relationships could be shown as a directed graph.

4
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:24,720
In this graph, each Node is a document, and each Edge shows a relationship between documents.

5
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:32,520
We could also use Groups and Tags to organize related knowledge.

6
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:40,080
This way, knowledge would not be just a set of separate files in folders.

7
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:43,920
It could become a connected network.

